      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Hardware keys offer superior protection because they prevent common attacks that SMS relies upon, such as SIM swapping and SMS interception. Unlike a code sent to a phone, a YubiKey requires physical possession and cryptographic proof, meaning an attacker can't steal your password and then hijack your account remotely. For a law firm dealing with sensitive client data, this resistance to phishing and interception provides a significantly higher, near-absolute level of security assurance. Highlighting this defense against sophisticated breaches is key to justifying the investment.",
